29tv|n|Something that has short turns or angles. ; A molding running in a zigzag line; a chevron, or series of chevrons. See Illust. of Chevron, 3. ; See Boyau.	a:vqs,71,1;28oj,57,2~28oj,57,2;vqs,71,1	V:1gwb,52,1~1gwb,52,1	N:rr4,64,1;1gwb,62,2~1gwb,62,2;rr4,64,1
