29u0|n|A low, thorny, suffrutescent, crucifeous plant (Zilla myagroides) found in the deserts of Egypt. Its leaves are boiled in water, and eaten, by the Arabs.	a:rqc,33,2~rqc,33,2	n:rqc,39,3~rqc,39,3	N:1v6t,138,1~1v6t,138,1
